--- /dev/null
+++ b/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# Third-party notices
+
+Full license texts: `renderer/assets/licenses/`.
+
+| What | Source | License | How it's used |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Icons | [Lucide](https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide) | ISC | 35 icons compiled into `ui/icons.js` by `scripts/gen-icons.mjs` |
+| Inter (variable, latin) | [rsms/inter](https://github.com/rsms/inter) | OFL 1.1 | UI font for Glass, Light, Mac OS |
+| Noto Sans (variable, latin) | [notofonts](https://github.com/notofonts) via fontsource | OFL 1.1 | UI font for Frutiger Aero, Windows XP |
+| JetBrains Mono (variable, latin) | [JetBrains/JetBrainsMono](https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono) | OFL 1.1 | Terminal and 2-bit themes, timestamps |
+| Easing + keyframe tokens | [Open Props](https://github.com/argyleink/open-props) | MIT | `assets/open-props.css` (spring and ease curves) |
+| Aero gradients and button states | [7.css](https://github.com/khang-nd/7.css) | MIT | Values re-implemented as theme variables in `themes.css` |
+| Luna title bar, buttons, hover glow | [XP.css](https://github.com/botoxparty/XP.css) | MIT | Values re-implemented in `themes.css` |
+| System 6 window look (stripes, hard shadows) | [system.css](https://github.com/sakofchit/system.css) | MIT | Design language re-implemented; no assets copied |
+| hls.js | [video-dev/hls.js](https://github.com/video-dev/hls.js) | Apache-2.0 | Player (unchanged) |
+
+Deliberately not used: Apple's Monaco and the Chicago/Geneva recreations bundled in system.css, and XP.css's pixel fonts (unclear or proprietary licensing).
